<title>SPAIN: Spain's Acciona makes post-merger Q1 profit.</title>
<headline>Spain's Acciona makes post-merger Q1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for first quarter 1997 in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit			    2.48    vs    n/a</p>
<p> Turnover				  73.98    vs    n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name Grupo Acciona. The construction company, which was created from the merger of Cubiertas and Entrecanales, Tavora and Eur, said there were no comparison results because it was the first quarter following the merger. The company said it was on target to end 1997 with pre-tax profit of 12 billion pesetas and turnover of 340 billion.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
</text>
